{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:0ce246715b71c486","name":"Noghri Strike Leader","source":{"id":"source:reference-0ce246715b71c486","title":"Noghri Strike Leader","revision":21695,"timestamp":"2024-08-26T02:18:07Z","sha256":"024461b46b0171e4a3bed0dd23b8a9f025063a0392ffa2949e119ff87fb1aabf","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=21695","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Noghri%20Strike%20Leader&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-0ce246715b71c486","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dawn of Defiance"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dawn_of_Defiance"}," (",{"tag":"a","children":["Echoes of the Jedi"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Echoes_of_the_Jedi","referenceId":"reference:e6a2e80208e1e351"},")"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Affiliations: ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Galactic Empire"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Galactic_Empire","referenceId":"reference:f9c9a48674cc3415"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["In a flash, you are assaulted by aliens that look like gargoyles. They are short and blindingly fast. As the chaos of combat ensues, you can't be sure, but the frightening faces of these warriors look like they might have been inspired by the armored mask of a certain Sith Lord- or vice-versa."]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The gray-skinned and compact ",{"tag":"a","children":["Noghri"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Noghri","referenceId":"reference:3b34c955e2b5b5b3"}," are among the most recent and deadly additions to the Imperial ranks. Though an acute xenophobia has begun to manifest within ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Galactic Empire"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Galactic_Empire","referenceId":"reference:f9c9a48674cc3415"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Darth Vader"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Darth_Vader","referenceId":"reference:c167be702b56cffc"}," readily recognized the value of the Species during a visit to their homeworld Honoghr. When the meter-tall warriors proved a match for his ",{"tag":"a","children":["501st Legion Stormtrooper"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/501st_Legion_Stormtrooper","referenceId":"reference:96b7b5430b04c0a5"}," escort, the Dark Lord immediately found a way to enslave the Species. Destiny arguably brought the two together, for the Noghri's frightful faces so resemble the masked visage of their new master, the likeness seems uncanny.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Dubbed \"Death Commandos,\" the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Noghri"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Noghri","referenceId":"reference:3b34c955e2b5b5b3"}," are perfectly evolved killing machines- quick, quiet and deceptively strong. In unarmed combat, they excel at stava, their martial art named after a ferocious native predator, and they wield ",{"tag":"a","children":["Stokhli Spray Sticks"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stokhli_Spray_Sticks"}," or simple knives with deadly efficiency. Vader bestowed ",{"tag":"a","children":["Valin Draco"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Valin_Draco","referenceId":"reference:225b744e6f6a9bf6"}," with this squad of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Noghri"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Noghri","referenceId":"reference:3b34c955e2b5b5b3"}," in gratitude for the Inquisitor's assistance in torturing the captured Jedi Knight ",{"tag":"a","children":["Halagad Ventor"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Halagad_Ventor?action=edit&redlink=1"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Noghri Strike Leader Statistics (CL 8)"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Normal"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Small ",{"tag":"a","children":["Noghri"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Noghri","referenceId":"reference:3b34c955e2b5b5b3"}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Soldier"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Soldier","referenceId":"reference:f826baa05bef6921"}